Even if you don't have or don't go for the ascension kit; it depends on
what objects you have and what your stats ar to decide what's missing.
My recent ascensions ranged from 151 to 379 maxHP's, and AC's from 19
to 39 with an average around AC=30.

> HP and AC:
> How the Gehennom do you *get* 300 hp? 

My way is mostly drinking blessed potions of full healing, if necessary.
You want to manufactor these potions yourself, if you know the alchemy.
Sometimes also gain level effects (but a high level has drawbacks, so
I usually abstain). You can (though I don't bother) dance with nurses.

> I have 17 !oFH - if I wanted to
> boost my HP but still have "enough" to survive Air, how many should I
> drink/save? 

I wouldn't drink any if you are not in need. Even if you are very low
at HP's you will always get the _full_ healing effect. I save as many
as I have, dring only a few if I want to get below some carry capacity
limit and don't want to drop anything else. But always save some for
the final run; how many to save depends on your specific situation; a
dozen seems appropriate.

